r: The Bone Temple. In a continuation of the epic story, Dr. Kelson (Ralph Fiennes) finds himself in a shocking new relationship - with consequences that could change the world as they know it - and Spike's (Alfie Williams) encounter with Jimmy ...</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"buttons\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"https://thelexicinema.co.uk/TheLexiCinema.dll/WhatsOn?f=9467962\" class=\"button\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"More Info\">More Info</a></li>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"https://thelexicinema.co.uk/TheLexiCinema.dll/WhatsOn?f=9467962\" class=\"button action\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Book now\">Book Now</a></li>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"carousel-film-image image\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/TLC/9480407.png\" alt=\"28 Years Later: The Bone Temple\"/>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item item-15 programme-type-611\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"carousel-slide-overlay\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"film-title\">Annemarie Jacir: When I Saw You</h3>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"subtitle\">Showing from Sun 8 Feb</h4>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"synopsis hide-for-small\">Presented in collaboration with Brent &amp; Harrow PSC.    Sunday's screening will have a live introduction by critic, author and broadcaster Hanna Ines Flint.    This film is part of a season celebrating the films of Palestinian director Annemarie Jacir ( Palestine 36 ), running from January to March.    You can find the other films in the season and information about our wider year-long season spotl...</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"buttons\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"https://thelexicinema.co.uk/TheLexiCinema.dll/WhatsOn?f=9386807\" class=\"button\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"More Info\">More Info</a></li>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"https://thelexicinema.co.uk/TheLexiCinema.dll/WhatsOn?f=9386807\" class=\"button action\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Book now\">Book Now</a></li>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\r\n\t\t