oking?Booking=TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_9470291.TcsSection_5209807\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Go to booking for 19:00\">\r\n<i id=\"Ticket_9470291\" class=\"fa fa-ticket-alt\"></i>\r\n<span id=\"PerformanceTime_9470291\" class=\"time\">19:00</span>\r\n<span class=\"tag screen screen2\" data-tooltip=\"Screen 2\">S2</span>\r\n</a>\r\n</div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"performance  columns is-multiline\">\r\n<span class=\"date column is-12\">Wed 11 Feb</span>\r\n<div class=\"column\">\r\n<a id=\"Performance_9470293\" class=\"button booking \" href=\"Booking?Booking=TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_9470293.TcsSection_5209705\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Go to booking for 19:00\">\r\n<i id=\"Ticket_9470293\" class=\"fa fa-ticket-alt\"></i>\r\n<span id=\"PerformanceTime_9470293\" class=\"time\">19:00</span>\r\n<span class=\"tag screen screen1\" data-tooltip=\"Screen 1\">S1</span>\r\n</a>\r\n</div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li class=\"performance  columns is-multiline\">\r\n<span class=\"date column is-12\">Thu 12 Feb</span>\r\n<div class=\"column\">\r\n<a id=\"Performance_9470434\" class=\"button booking \" href=\"Booking?Booking=TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_9470434.TcsSection_5209807\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Go to booking for 19:00\">\r\n<i id=\"Ticket_9470434\" class=\"fa fa-ticket-alt\"></i>\r\n<span id=\"PerformanceTime_9470434\" class=\"time\">19:00</span>\r\n<span class=\"tag screen screen2\" data-tooltip=\"Screen 2\">S2</span>\r\n</a>\r\n</div>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <h3 class=\"subtitle is-underlined\"><span>Details</span></h3>\r\n<div id=\"TheVideo\" onclick=\"thevid=document.getElementById('thevideo')\r\nthevid.style.display='block'; this.style.display='none';\r\ndocument.getElementById('ytplayer').src =\r\ndocument.getElementById('ytplayer').src.replace('autoplay=0','autoplay=1');\">\r\n<img style=\"cursor: pointer;\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/TLC/9467978.png\" alt=\"\" /><div class=\"play\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"play trailer\" tabindex=0></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"thevideo\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n<iframe id=\"ytplayer\" rel=\"WG8_CBw2U1A\" type=\"text/html\" width=\"100%\" height=\"350\"src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/WG8_CBw2U1A?fs=1&autoplay=0&modestbranding=1&rel=0&showinfo=0&theme=light\"frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\r\n</div>\r\n      <ul class=\"info is-hidden-mobile\">\r\n        <li>Runtime: 139 minutes</li>\r\n        <li>Director: Park Chan-wook</li>\r\n        <li>Cast: Lee Byung-hun, Son Ye-jin, Park Hee-soon</li>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n        <li>Rating: (15)</li>\r\n      </ul>\r\n<ul class=\"tags is-relative\">\r\n<li><span class=\"tag programme-type-611\">Film</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"column programme-synopsis\">\r\n      <h1 class=\"title\">No Other Choice</h1>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\"><span style=\" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">A long-time employee at a paper company, Man-su (Lee Byung Hun) happily spends his days with his wife Miri (Son Yejin) and family &#8211; until he's abruptly fired.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\"><span style=\" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\"><br /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\"><span style=\" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">After spending a year drifting from one job interview to another, and finally getting humiliated by a company where he knows he&#8217;s better qualified than anyone else, he resolves to create an opening for himself &#8211; by any means necessary.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\"><span style=\" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\"><br /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\"><span style=\" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: italic; font-weight: bold; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">Please arrive promptly - we show 10 minutes of trailers before each film and do not show adverts.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n      <ul class=\"info is-hidden-tablet is-hidden-desktop\">\r\n        <li>Runtime: 139 minutes</li>\r\n        <li>Director: Park Chan-wook</li>\r\n        <li>Cast: Lee Byung-hun, Son Ye-jin, Park Hee-soon</li>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n        <li>Rating: (15)</li>\r\n      </ul>\r\n<ul class=\"tags is-relative\">\r\n<li><span class=\"tag programme-type-611\">Film</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"column is-ancestor tile is-vertical is-one-third programme-performances is-hidden-mobile\">\r\n      <div class=\"tile is-vertical\">\r\n        <h3 class=\"subtitle is-underlined\"><span>Times</span></h3>\r\n        <div id=\"listings\" class=\"content programme-info-content\">\r\n<ul class=\"performances\">\r\n<li class=\"performance  columns is-mul