mily: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">Emerald Fennell (A Promising Young Woman, Saltburn) presents Wuthering Heights, Emily Bront&#235;'s gothic masterpiece of unbridled passion, obsession, and revenge. Set against the desolate beauty of the Yorkshire moors, the all-consuming love between Catherine Earnshaw (Margot Robbie) and the foundling Heathcliff (Jacob Elordi) has captivated readers for centuries. When forces of class and society tear them apart, Heathcliff embarks on a bitter quest for vengeance that threatens to destroy two generations of the Linton and Earnshaw families.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\"><span style=\" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\"><br /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\"><span style=\" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: italic; font-weight: bold; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;\">Please arrive promptly - we show 10 minutes of trailers before each film and do not show adverts.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n      <ul class=\"info is-hidden-tablet is-hidden-desktop\">\r\n        <li>Runtime: 140 minutes</li>\r\n        <li>Director: Emerald Fennell</li>\r\n        <li>Cast: Margot Robbie, Jacob Elordi, Shazad Latif</li>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n      </ul>\r\n<ul class=\"tags is-relative\">\r\n<li><span class=\"tag programme-type-611\">Film</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"column is-ancestor tile is-vertical is-one-third programme-performances is-hidden-